[00:21.40]Jehovah is faithful and fully aware
[00:26.56]Of all those who serve him whole-souled.
[00:33.18]He knows there are times their devotion and zeal
[00:39.75]Result in their loss as foretold.
[00:45.72]If you have left houses or fam’ly or friends,
[00:52.20]Be sure that our God knows the sum.
[00:58.28]He makes it up now with our dear brotherhood
[01:04.80]And life in the new world to come.
[01:10.31](Chorus)
[01:10.46]May Jehovah reward what you have done.
[01:17.24]May he provide a perfect wage for you.
[01:23.52]May you find refuge beneath his wings.
[01:29.28]Jehovah is faithful; Jehovah is true.
[02:10.12]At times we may feel that our lot in this life
[02:16.12]Has burdened us more than our share.
[02:22.50]And sometimes it seems that the cares of the day
[02:29.32]Are more than we’re able to bear.
[02:35.25]The God of all comfort takes note of your need;
[02:41.82]You know he’s the Hearer of prayer.
[02:48.08]His Word and his spirit and true, loving friends
[02:54.92]Will bring to you comfort and care.
[03:00.15](Chorus)
[03:00.30]May Jehovah reward what you have done.
[03:07.42]May he provide a perfect wage for you.
[03:13.82]May you find refuge beneath his wings.
[03:19.46]Jehovah is faithful; Jehovah is true.
